<title>USA: Univ of Med/Dentistry, N.J., repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Univ of Med/Dentistry, N.J., repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it repriced and restructured University of Medicine and Dentistry, N.J., $20 million Certificate of Participation (series A) bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>CERTIFICATES OF PARTICIPATION (SERIES A)</p>
<p>RE: $19,700,000*</p>
<p>Evidencing Undivided Interests of the Owners</p>
<p>Therof in a Portion of Certain Sceduled Amounts</p>
<p>of the Fixed Rent Payments to be Made by the</p>
<p>University of Medicine and Dentistry of New Jersey</p>
<p>Pursuant to a Lease Agreement with George Street</p>
<p>Redevelopment Urban Renewal Associates L.L.C.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA	MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 08/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1998</p>
